  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "This solution is correct.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 1360,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 41,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "The scan itself is O of n.",
      "start_ms": 1780,
      "end_ms": 3740,
      "start_frame": 53,
      "end_frame": 112,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "But before scanning, we sorted the array.",
      "start_ms": 4160,
      "end_ms": 6800,
      "start_frame": 125,
      "end_frame": 204,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Sorting costs O of n log n.",
      "start_ms": 7300,
      "end_ms": 9700,
      "start_frame": 219,
      "end_frame": 291,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "So overall, O of n log n.",
      "start_ms": 10040,
      "end_ms": 13400,
      "start_frame": 301,
      "end_frame": 402,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "The question asks for O of n.",
      "start_ms": 13800,
      "end_ms": 15860,
      "start_frame": 414,
      "end_frame": 476,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Now think about what we actually needed from sorting.",
      "start_ms": 16380,
      "end_ms": 18840,
      "start_frame": 491,
      "end_frame": 565,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "We only wanted to know, does the next value exist?",
      "start_ms": 19600,
      "end_ms": 23420,
      "start_frame": 588,
      "end_frame": 703,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Do we really need to arrange every number just for that?",
      "start_ms": 24300,
      "end_ms": 27800,
      "start_frame": 729,
      "end_frame": 834,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "start_ms": 28520,
      "end_ms": 28980,
      "start_frame": 856,
      "end_frame": 869,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "A hash set can answer existence checks quickly on average.",
      "start_ms": 29820,
      "end_ms": 33680,
      "start_frame": 895,
      "end_frame": 1010,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "But there is still one danger.",
      "start_ms": 34120,
      "end_ms": 36060,
      "start_frame": 1024,
      "end_frame": 1082,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "If we start walking from every number, we can repeat the same sequence again and again.",
      "start_ms": 36580,
      "end_ms": 42760,
      "start_frame": 1097,
      "end_frame": 1283,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "So the real question is, how do we know where a sequence actually begins?",
      "start_ms": 43500,
      "end_ms": 49380,
      "start_frame": 1305,
      "end_frame": 1481,
      "word_count": 14
    }
  ],
  "pauses": [
    {
